## 2. Directory Structure & Modular Layout

Organize all source code strictly into domain-centric features under `src/app/`:

```text
src/app/
├── core/                         # Singletons: services, guards, interceptors, auth config
│   ├── auth/
│   │   ├── auth.service.ts       # Mock + OIDC auth state manager (signal-based)
│   │   ├── auth.guard.ts         # Authenticated-only route protection
│   │   ├── role.guard.ts         # RBAC access controller (data.roles)
│   │   ├── tenant.guard.ts       # Enforces organizationId scoping
│   │   ├── auth.interceptor.ts   # Functional: bearer token + tenant header
│   │   └── mock-users.ts         # Dev credential table (Section 4)
│   ├── http/
│   │   ├── api.service.ts        # Typed wrapper; unwraps ApiResult<T> envelope
│   │   ├── api-result.ts         # ApiResult<T> contract + unwrap helpers
│   │   ├── api-paths.ts          # Centralized route builders (/api/v1/...)
│   │   └── retry.interceptor.ts  # Functional: 503 rate-limit backoff
│   ├── models/                   # Organization, User, Training, Category, Result, Message
│   ├── services/                 # Organization context, toast, messaging services
│   └── stores/                   # Signal stores for shared application state
├── shared/                       # Reusable UI, pipes, directives
│   ├── components/               # Navbar, Sidebar, StatCard, ToastContainer, ModalShell,
│   │                             # OrgSwitcher, DataTable, EmptyState, ErrorState, Spinner
│   ├── directives/               # Drag-and-drop upload, hasRole, hasTenant
│   └── pipes/                    # Status badge styling, duration formatter, role label
├── features/                     # Feature domains (all lazy-loaded)
│   ├── super-admin/              # Platform dashboard, Org management, Org-Admin creator
│   ├── organizations/            # Org listing, org entry form, org detail view
│   ├── auth/                     # Login, Register, Forgot Password
│   ├── dashboard/                # OrgAdmin, Instructor, Learner dashboards
│   ├── users/                    # User/Staff listings, creation, details
│   ├── categories/               # Training category listing & creation
│   ├── trainings/                # Training creation, category view, assignment
│   ├── processing/               # Training design & material upload (.docx/.pdf)
│   ├── user-portal/              # Learner training & score portal
│   └── staff-ops/                # Trainee operations, direct messaging, course assignment
├── layout/                       # App shell: Sidebar, Header, Org Switcher Header
