├── app.config.ts                 # Providers (HttpClient, Router, interceptors, OIDC)
├── app.routes.ts                 # Route matrix with lazy loading (Section 6)
└── app.component.ts              # Root application shell
```

**Dependency rule:** `features/` may import from `core/` and `shared/`. `core/` and `shared/`
must never import from `features/`. Features must not import from each other; share through
`core/stores/` or `core/models/`.

**Naming overrides the CLI default.** Angular 22 scaffolds suffix-less files (`app.ts`,
class `App`). This project uses the explicit type suffix throughout — `app.component.ts`
exporting `AppComponent`, `user-list.component.ts`, `auth.service.ts`, `role.guard.ts`,
`training.store.ts`. Keep it consistent; do not reintroduce the CLI style.

**Local setup.** `src/environments/environment.development.ts` is gitignored. Run
`npm run setup:env` to create it from the committed `.example` file before `npm start`.

